"출처: MBRIS 통합종정보 <a href=\"https://newsseoul.co.kr/news/view/1065594623082008\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">해양수산부 보도(2024-03-26)</a> · 해양생물 공간정보시스템 <a href=\"https://m.dailian.co.kr/news/view/1060200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">데일리안(2021-12-06)</a> · 해양바이오뱅크 <a href=\"https://www.dailian.co.kr/news/view/981448/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">데일리안(2021-04-13)</a>, <a href=\"https://newsseoul.co.kr/news/view/1065572416659195\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">해양수산부 보도(2023-11-27)</a> · 국가 목록 <a href=\"https://www.mbris.kr/pub/marine/natilist/nationalist.do\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MBRIS 국가 해양수산생물종 목록</a>":"Sources: MBRIS integrated species information <a href=\"https://newsseoul.co.kr/news/view/1065594623082008\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ministry of Oceans and Fisheries report (2024-03-26)</a> · Marine Life Spatial Information System <a href=\"https://m.dailian.co.kr/news/view/1060200\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dailian (2021-12-06)</a> · Marine Bio Bank <a href=\"https://www.dailian.co.kr/news/view/981448/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dailian (2021-04-13)</a>, <a href=\"https://newsseoul.co.kr/news/view/1065572416659195\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ministry of Oceans and Fisheries report (2023-11-27)</a> · National list <a href=\"https://www.mbris.kr/pub/marine/natilist/nationalist.do\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MBRIS National List of Marine Species</a>",
"지표는 어떻게 계산하나요?":"How are the indices calculated?",
"전체 산출 흐름 · 지표별 산식":"Full calculation flow · formula for each index",
